{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "61649220-3dd5-56a5-8ed9-7ba5436035dc",
    "name": "Mahal — Logística",
    "description": "Coleção de testes do módulo **Logística** (`/logistica`) do mahal-backend.\n\n> **Status do módulo: esqueleto.** Hoje existe apenas `GET /logistica/shipments` (listagem paginada de\n> remessas), que responde 200 com página vazia enquanto não houver escrita no domínio.\n> Esta coleção valida o contrato de paginação, a validação dos parâmetros e a proteção por\n> permissão — e é o lugar para acrescentar as requisições conforme o módulo for implementado.\n\nDocumentação do módulo: `docs/dominios/logistica/README.md`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{accessToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8082",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "username",
      "value": "admin",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "password",
      "value": "Admin@dev1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "totpCode",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "accessToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "refreshToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "challengeToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "permissions",
      "value": "[]",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "00 — Autenticação",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{username}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Autentica com usuário/senha e guarda o `accessToken` na coleção.\n\nSe o usuário tiver 2FA ativo a resposta é `PENDING_2FA`: preencha a variável `totpCode` e rode a requisição seguinte.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "",
                  "if (json.status === 'PENDING_2FA') {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('challengeToken', json.challengeToken);",
                  "    console.warn('2FA ativo — preencha {{totpCode}} e rode \"Login 2FA — concluir\".');",
                  "} else {",
                  "    pm.test('Retorna accessToken e refreshToken', () => {",
                  "        pm.expect(json.accessToken, 'accessToken').to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;",
                  "        pm.expect(json.refreshToken, 'refreshToken').to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;",
                  "    });",
                  "    pm.test('tokenType = Bearer', () => pm.expect(json.tokenType).to.eql('Bearer'));",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', json.accessToken);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', json.refreshToken);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('challengeToken', '');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login 2FA — concluir",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/2fa/verify",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "2fa",
                "verify"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"challengeToken\": \"{{challengeToken}}\",\n  \"code\": \"{{totpCode}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Só é necessária quando o login devolve `PENDING_2FA`. É ignorada automaticamente quando não há challenge pendente.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (!pm.collectionVariables.get('challengeToken')) {",
                  "    console.log('Sem challenge de 2FA pendente — requisição ignorada.');",
                  "    if (pm.execution && pm.execution.skipRequest) pm.execution.skipRequest();",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', json.accessToken);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', json.refreshToken);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('challengeToken', '');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Perfil e permissões do usuário logado",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users/me",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "users",
                "me"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Confere se o token funciona e se o usuário tem as permissões exigidas por Logística. Guarda a lista em `{{permissions}}` para as requisições que dependem de permissões DEV."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "const perms = json.permissions || [];",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('permissions', JSON.stringify(perms));",
                  "",
                  "const required = [\"LOGISTICA_READ\"];",
                  "pm.test('Usuário tem as permissões do módulo', () => {",
                  "    const missing = required.filter(p => !perms.includes(p));",
                  "    pm.expect(missing, 'permissões faltando: ' + missing.join(', ')).to.be.an('array').that.is.empty;",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "description": "Rode esta pasta primeiro. O `accessToken` fica salvo na coleção e é reaproveitado por todas as outras requisições."
    },
    {
      "name": "01 — Listagem",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Listar remessas (paginado)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/logistica/shipments?page=0&size=20",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "logistica",
                "shipments"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "page",
                  "value": "0"
                },
                {
                  "key": "size",
                  "value": "20"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "`LOGISTICA_READ`. Devolve um `PageResult`; hoje o conteúdo vem vazio."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Estrutura de PageResult', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(json.content).to.be.an('array');",
                  "    pm.expect(json.page).to.eql(0);",
                  "    pm.expect(json.size).to.eql(20);",
                  "    pm.expect(json.totalElements).to.be.a('number');",
                  "    pm.expect(json.totalPages).to.be.a('number');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar com página e tamanho customizados",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/logistica/shipments?page=1&size=5",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "logistica",
                "shipments"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "page",
                  "value": "1"
                },
                {
                  "key": "size",
                  "value": "5"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Confere que os parâmetros são refletidos na resposta."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Ecoa page=1 e size=5', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(json.page).to.eql(1);",
                  "    pm.expect(json.size).to.eql(5);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "02 — Validação e segurança",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Erro: page negativa → 400",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/logistica/shipments?page=-1&size=20",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "logistica",
                "shipments"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "page",
                  "value": "-1"
                },
                {
                  "key": "size",
                  "value": "20"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "O controller é `@Validated`: `page` ≥ 0."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 400', () => pm.response.to.have.status(400));",
                  "pm.test('errorCode = VALIDATION_ERROR',",
                  "    () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().errorCode).to.eql('VALIDATION_ERROR'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Erro: size acima do teto → 400",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/logistica/shipments?page=0&size=500",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "logistica",
                "shipments"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "page",
                  "value": "0"
                },
                {
                  "key": "size",
                  "value": "500"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "`size` aceita de 1 a 100."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 400', () => pm.response.to.have.status(400));",
                  "pm.test('errorCode = VALIDATION_ERROR',",
                  "    () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().errorCode).to.eql('VALIDATION_ERROR'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Sem token → 401",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/logistica/shipments",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "logistica",
                "shipments"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Confirma que o endpoint está protegido: sem `Authorization` a resposta é 401.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 401', () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "99 — Encerramento",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Logout (revoga o refresh token)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/logout",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "logout"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Revoga o refresh token da sessão. O accessToken continua válido até expirar."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 204', () => pm.response.to.have.status(204));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', '');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
